		<h3>Daily Fiction</h3>
		<h1>Gaining Ground</h1>
		<h2>By Joan Barfoot</h2>
		<div class="img-excerpt-container">
			<div class="img-container"><img src="https://s26162.pcdn.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Gaining-Ground-cover.jpg" alt="Gaining Ground"></div>
			<div class="excerpt-container"><div class="excerpt"><em>The following is from Joan Barfoot's </em>Gaining Ground<em>. Barfoot (born 1946) is the author of eleven novels, which reviewers have celebrated as “harrowing and hilarious” and “gloriously subversive.” She has been longlisted for the Man Booker Prize, shortlisted for the Scotiabank Giller Prize, and received the Marian Engel Award. She lives in London, Ontario, Canada.</em></div></div>
